sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer UI
  participant API as Spring Boot API
  participant DB as MySQL inventory
  participant P as Payment provider
  C->>API: POST /shows/{id}/holds + Idempotency-Key
  API->>DB: Begin transaction and lock selected show_seats
  DB-->>API: Locked, current seat state
  API->>DB: Create expiring hold and update seat rows
  API-->>C: Hold token and expiry
  C->>API: Create payment order / simulator decision
  API->>DB: Lock held inventory and verify ownership/expiry
  API->>P: Create/verify gateway payment (when Razorpay mode)
  P-->>API: Payment result / signature
  API->>DB: Create booking, mark seats BOOKED, publish outbox event
  API-->>C: Booking result
